  "title": "Marathon Bancorp, Inc. Extends Community Offering",
  "summary": "Wausau, Wisconsin, March 24, 2025 — Marathon Bancorp, Inc. (the “Company”) (OTC Pink: MBBC), the holding company for Marathon Bank (the “Bank”), announced today that the Company has extended the community offering to allow additional time to sell shares of its common stock. The terms and conditions of the community offering are more fully set",
